# Local-dev env files must never leak into a Docker build context — the
# admin-panel image once baked in a stray apps/admin-panel/.env.local
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api, a local-dev convenience
# value) that silently overrode the correct build-arg for every visitor in
# production, because Next.js's own .env.local loading takes precedence
# over the Docker ENV set from --build-arg. This file exists specifically
# so that mistake can't happen again, for any app in this monorepo.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/generated
